{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）昨天（13日）推出全新單曲《goofy》，這是他個人音樂生涯中首支國語跳唱作品，更是他相隔多時再推出派對快歌。</p><p>今次歌曲打破以往極具爆發力的風格，以輕鬆中板 R&amp;B節奏登場，呈獻耳目一新「鬆弛感」。</p><p>Anson Lo全權主導MV拍攝的視覺創作，並透露一星期後將再有另一首全新作品接力登場。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.685946+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:11:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:37:36.435294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"cb322d7ef81b02e673bf09d6afa6f4314bb946fd190c07062dfb8879581dc909","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}